(=== Section 1.0 - Service Level Objectives ===) Tj T*
(DOCUMENT CODE: SOP-CX-004 | DEPARTMENT: Customer Experience & Quality Assurance) Tj T*
(TITLE: Tiered Customer Complaint Resolution and SLA Escalation SOP) Tj T*
(OWNER: VP of Customer Success | EFFECTIVE DATE: 2026-02-10) Tj T*
(1.0 Objective: Ensure structured intake, severity triage, root-cause investigation, goodwill credit approval, and regulatory escalation for enterprise customer complaints.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(=== Section 2.0 - Intake, Triage, and Investigation ===) Tj T*
(Step 1 [ACT-301] Log Customer Complaint and Acknowledge Receipt | Role: Customer Support Specialist \(Customer Experience\) | Type: manual) Tj T*
(Description: Record customer complaint in Salesforce Service Cloud, attach evidence logs, and send automated 15-minute SLA acknowledgement.) Tj T*
(Input: Customer Complaint Submission, Account Telemetry Logs | Output: Logged Case Ticket) Tj T*
(Preconditions: Customer holds active service agreement | Postconditions: Case ID created and SLA timer started) Tj T*
(Dependencies: None) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Step 2 [ACT-302] Triage Complaint Severity and Regulatory Impact | Role: Quality Assurance Team Lead \(Quality Assurance\) | Type: decision) Tj T*
(Description: Classify complaint into Severity-1 \(Regulatory/Data Privacy Breach\), Severity-2 \(Service Outage with SLA Credit\), or Severity-3 \(Standard Defect\).) Tj T*
(Input: Logged Case Ticket | Output: Severity Triage Classification) Tj T*
(Preconditions: Case ticket logged with initial facts | Postconditions: Severity tier assigned) Tj T*
(Dependencies: ACT-301) Tj T*
(DECISION RULE [COND-301]: IF credit_requested >= $1,000 THEN route to ACT-304 ELSE route to ACT-303.) Tj T*
(EXCEPTION RULE [EXC-301]: IF complaint involves GDPR/HIPAA privacy breach OR regulatory threat THEN escalate to Data Privacy & Legal Response Team within 2 hours \(Target: ACT-306\). Remediation: Freeze affected tenant logs and initiate statutory incident response.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Step 3 [ACT-303] Execute Technical Root Cause Analysis and Service Remediation | Role: L3 Incident Resolution Engineer \(Engineering Operations\) | Type: manual) Tj T*
(Description: Reproduce reported issue, deploy configuration hotfix or data correction, and document 5-Whys Root Cause Analysis.) Tj T*
(Input: Severity Triage Classification, Account Telemetry Logs | Output: Root Cause & Remediation Report) Tj T*
(Preconditions: Complaint triaged as technical/operational issue | Postconditions: Technical fix verified in customer environment) Tj T*
(Dependencies: ACT-302) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
