(=== Section 3.0 - Financial Credit Approval and Closure ===) Tj T*
(Step 4 [ACT-304] Approve Customer SLA Service Credit or Refund | Role: Director of Customer Operations \(Customer Experience\) | Type: approval) Tj T*
(Description: Review SLA downtime calculation and approve billing credit or refund >= $1,000.) Tj T*
(Input: Root Cause & Remediation Report, SLA Credit Calculation | Output: Approved Credit Authorization) Tj T*
(Preconditions: Customer claim >= $1,000 validated against contract SLA | Postconditions: Credit memo authorized for billing) Tj T*
(Dependencies: ACT-302, ACT-303) Tj T*
(APPROVAL GATE [APR-301]: Approver: Director of Customer Operations | Criteria: Verified SLA breach duration and contract penalty clause for credits >= $1,000 | SLA: 8 hours | Rejection Target: ACT-305.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Step 5 [ACT-305] Dispatch Final Resolution Report and Close Case | Role: Customer Success Manager \(Customer Experience\) | Type: notification) Tj T*
(Description: Deliver formal RCA summary and credit confirmation to customer executive sponsor and mark ticket RESOLVED.) Tj T*
(Input: Root Cause & Remediation Report, Approved Credit Authorization | Output: Customer Resolution Closure Notice) Tj T*
(Preconditions: Technical remediation complete and credit decision finalized | Postconditions: Case closed and CSAT survey triggered) Tj T*
(Dependencies: ACT-303, ACT-304) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Step 6 [ACT-306] Manage Regulatory Compliance and Privacy Breach Escalation | Role: Data Privacy & Legal Response Team \(Legal & Compliance\) | Type: escalation) Tj T*
(Description: Conduct forensic privacy assessment, draft regulatory notification if required, and coordinate legal communication.) Tj T*
(Input: Logged Case Ticket, Severity Triage Classification | Output: Regulatory Incident Disposition) Tj T*
(Preconditions: Severity-1 regulatory or privacy trigger identified | Postconditions: Legal hold and regulatory compliance protocol executed) Tj T*
(Dependencies: ACT-302) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
